# Phaser

- Scene lifecycle: create resources in `create`, clean up listeners in shutdown/destroy
- Physics body sizes should match visible sprites; avoid oversized hitboxes
- Never allocate heavily inside `update()` (no per-frame `new` for hot paths)
- Emit UI intent via `phaserEvents` only — no React imports
- Disable keyboard capture when React modal/chat has focus
- Collision only on the `Collision` layer via `collides: true`
- Zone `buildingId` / `npcId` must match `client/src/content/`
